This directory vendors the Hamiltonian Updates implementation (hamiltonian_updates.py,
hu_binary_search.py, gate_count.py) as included in the `sdp_qubo_benchmarking`
repository (Ostermann, Garnowski, Henze, Jha, Dia, Fiand, Gross, Gross, Nowak,
de Wolff; arXiv:2503.10801).

That repository's own README states its own code and data are MIT-licensed, but
that this specific HU implementation is "licensed under the BSD-3-Clause License
and the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0) License",
citing Henze et al., DOI 10.5281/zenodo.14871936 -- the same source as
third_party/hu_henze/. The BSD-3-Clause terms are reproduced there and apply here
identically; see third_party/hu_henze/LICENSE.

None of the MIT-licensed code from the `sdp_qubo_benchmarking` repository (its own
glue code, the GAMS qubo_solve tool, ManiSDP-matlab) is vendored in this directory.
